{"id":"8a909a60ed22217b","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part.md","title":"ZFC Model Well Founded Part","display":"df-zfc-model-well-founded-part — ZFC Model Well Founded Part","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part"],"display":"df-zfc-model-well-founded-part — ZFC Model Well Founded Part","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-well-founded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-well-founded-part — ZFC Model Well Founded Part"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,W,E\\in V\">\\(M,W,E\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq M\\times M\">\\(E\\subseteq M\\times M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelWellFoundedPart}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelWellFoundedPart}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelWellFoundedPart}_S(W,M,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nE\\subseteq M\\times M\\land\nW=\\{x\\in M:\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq M:x\\in Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall z\\in M\\;\n(\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in E\\to z\\in Y)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(E\\cap(C\\times C),C)\n\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelWellFoundedPart}_S(W,M,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nE\\subseteq M\\times M\\land\nW=\\{x\\in M:\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq M:x\\in Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall z\\in M\\;\n(\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in E\\to z\\in Y)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(E\\cap(C\\times C),C)\n\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is explicit, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is the least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>-predecessor-closed subset containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.  Thus the ternary predicate has no hidden model-membership relation or transitive-closure operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-well-founded]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,W,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq M\\times M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModelWellFoundedPart}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}part}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelWellFoundedPart}_S(W,M,E)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nE\\subseteq M\\times M\\land\nW=\\{x\\in M:\\exists C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq M:x\\in Y\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\forall z\\in M\\;\n(\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in E\\to z\\in Y)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(E\\cap(C\\times C),C)\n\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1211,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2715","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part.md|58-df-zfc-model-well-founded-part]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9e70b896da231f4f"]}